# Deník listing

`/denik` uses `Sections/denik.twig`. Rituály and umění have their own listing layouts (`ritualy.twig`, `umeni.twig`).

## Layout

- Greige page ground; white header; soft white→greige header wash
- Posts grouped by **published** year
- Alternating photo + copy rows (photo left / right); featured first entry larger
- Photos reuse `.home-print` shadow + ≤0.5° tilt; keep native aspect ratio
- Title (often a diary date) in Fraunces; summary clamped to 3 lines; `zapsáno` = publishedAt
- Scroll reveal via `data-reveal` + `.is-in` (deník-scoped only; respects `prefers-reduced-motion`)
